      "created_at": "2012-09-22T22:43:03.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Has anybody noticed any changes in card counts between the first and second editions of the game? &nbsp;An alert poster on the Board Game Geek forums alerted me to a change in Absolute Zero's deck. &nbsp;He seems to have swapped out a Coolant Blast for an extra copy of Frost-Bound Drain. &nbsp;</p><p>I assume this is intentional, because it strikes me as a positive change, but I thought I'd make sure. &nbsp;Has anybody noticed anything else like this?</p>",
