      "id": 38980,
      "name": "Matchstickman",
      "username": "Matchstickman",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/matchstickman/{size}/1880_2.png",
      "created_at": "2012-09-23T16:46:57.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>It removes a questionably/situationally useful (imho) ongoing and adds a damaging one shot (which ironically combos nicely with the remove ongoin).</p><p>It makes it a 'better' deck because Frost-Bound Drain also combos well with Isothermic Transducer (the fire module), giving more opportunities to pull off such a move.</p><p><a href=\"http://sentinelsofthemultiverse.com/forum/topic/heros-guide-absolute-zero\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">Obligitory link to Flamethower49's guide</a></p>",
